.nh
.TH containers-storage-version 1 "August 2016"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
containers-storage-version \- Output version information about the storage library

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBcontainers-storage\fP \fBversion\fP

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Outputs version information about the storage library and \fIcontainers-storage\fP\&.

.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.EX
containers-storage version
.EE

.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
containers-storage-status(1)
